might have asked of you - it is yours. My payment is only from Allāh, and He is, over all things, Witness.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"34:48","t":"Say, \"Indeed, my Lord projects the truth, Knower of the unseen.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":48,"sd":null}],"juz":22,"hizb":44,"surahs":[34],"sajdah":false}